irst close above the base high of $502.50. Volume that day was 50.3M shares, 1.31x the prior 10-day average of 38.4M. It held, never closing below the level three days running, reached a best close of $695.00, and the chart ends at $663.69.","lesson":"This is an example of a breakout that worked on light volume. The volume rule is a guide, not a law. It tilts the odds, and here the stock beat them."}}